{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29093","headline":"题苏州虎丘寺僧院 · 许浑","name":"题苏州虎丘寺僧院","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"暂引寒泉濯远尘，此生多是异乡人。\n荆溪夜雨花开疾，吴苑秋风月满频。\n万里高低门外路，百年荣辱梦中身。\n世间谁似西林客，一卧烟霞四十春。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29093.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29093","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}